{
  "name": "dsh-tradingagents",
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "description": "TradingAgents, natively on DeepSeek Harness — multi-agent investment committee CLI (analyst / bull / bear / risk / PM, plus Buffett/Munger/Lynch/Wood guest seats) with evidence tags, PASS as a first-class verdict, auditable IC-MEMO output, and a zero-key OpenBB rich data card (CBOE quote/K-line/IV + SEC 10-K + nasdaq news).",
